WEBVTT

00:00:55.756 --> 00:01:00.556
the project made a provision to import
two million tons of coal annually

00:01:00.596 --> 00:01:01.836
from South Africa.

00:01:02.276 --> 00:01:04.436
So I ask again,

00:01:04.476 --> 00:01:06.996
Ghana and Africa need energy.

00:01:07.436 --> 00:01:09.756
But what kind of energy?

00:01:10.196 --> 00:01:16.156
In Africa, job creation and economic
opportunities are the priority,

00:01:16.196 --> 00:01:17.916
and those were the same arguments

00:01:17.916 --> 00:01:21.276
that were made by those
who were in support of the project.

00:01:21.276 --> 00:01:24.156
They claimed that the project
of the coal plant

00:01:24.156 --> 00:01:26.476
would have created jobs
for the local youth

00:01:26.476 --> 00:01:29.756
and also expanded the economy
of the country.